          "short": "$44$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}8\\times5\\frac{1}{2}&=8\\times\\left(5+\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\\\8\\times5\\frac{1}{2}&=(8\\times5)+\\left(8\\times\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\\\8\\times5\\frac{1}{2}&=40+4\\\\8\\times5\\frac{1}{2}&=44\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
